615" /><zone xml:id="m-d5334fee-c47e-46f5-9f96-1a7785246337" ulx="23" uly="604" lrx="886" lry="637" /><zone xml:id="m-9a301edd-ab8c-44f8-8223-f00c9551422b" ulx="22" uly="630" lrx="593" lry="669" /><zone xml:id="m-903790a4-651f-43fb-b9ac-7d7b373cf9a5" ulx="404" uly="677" lrx="503" lry="708" /><zone xml:id="m-f57cfcb5-8efe-4129-8f7e-4c3cd8bcc768" ulx="59" uly="704" lrx="887" lry="745" /><zone xml:id="m-3a413094-c2fe-4d6c-81d5-f248ccbaaf1d" ulx="24" uly="734" lrx="801" lry="775" /><zone xml:id="m-5a03eaab-383b-4449-afc5-0f20465c87ed" ulx="332" uly="779" lrx="573" lry="811" /><zone xml:id="m-d46fb2fc-d34d-4233-89f6-bc37a797c302" ulx="63" uly="808" lrx="886" lry="851" /><zone xml:id="m-ab00727d-dc3e-4b11-af6d-e684abdc6710" ulx="23" uly="837" lrx="878" lry="881" /><zone xml:id="m-ee0256ce-cd7c-4f3f-bd35-7496daf395c1" ulx="270" uly="897" lrx="643" lry="932" /><zone xml:id="m-a3d9346b-1190-41e6-ab21-4e5f1bcf799f" ulx="401" uly="945" lrx="514" lry="981" /><zone xml:id="m-55ba630c-c8a3-41fb-a3ba-55308b0f41b9" ulx="32" uly="977" lrx="885" lry="1019" /><zone xml:id="m-95541b32-7a34-45e8-bc49-9159d146a6e3" ulx="22" uly="1007" lrx="888" lry="1047" /><zone xml:id="m-78db354b-ac29-4957-b227-d960506f41a3" ulx="23" uly="1034" lrx="886" lry="1077" /><zone xml:id="m-caa7c597-3118-499d-9c6f-454908208798" ulx="404" uly="1080" lrx="503" lry="1114" /><zone xml:id="m-1e230983-b484-4a85-8a90-348a79e5e3cf" ulx="44" uly="1113" lrx="884" lry="1158" /><zone xml:id="m-951354c0-9958-4cb6-bc8a-34ee7399c574" ulx="23" uly="1144" lrx="888" lry="1185" /><zone xml:id="m-389da6ce-74ba-4d78-b910-cce1e0f1181d" ulx="21" uly="1174" lrx="886" lry="1210" /><zone xml:id="m-31ed840c-2427-4519-84f4-1678b6319ddf" ulx="19" uly="1200" lrx="858" lry="1238" /><zone xml:id="m-d18e7d94-f772-4648-8c96-737a8270e296" ulx="333" uly="1242" lrx="570" lry="1282" /><zone xml:id="m-8a5368b7-ab63-4771-8589-8f40ef310f48" ulx="58" uly="1280" lrx="883" lry="1320" /><zone xml:id="m-1300e82f-f0c5-46a4-ba53-54c12aea85b1" ulx="22" uly="1308" lrx="732" lry="1345" /><zone xml:id="m-b69865f2-44a2-41aa-ba19-64fd7766826e" ulx="24" uly="1335" lrx="459" lry="1372" /><zone xml:id="m-838b6b3b-9180-448e-9d8a-f58e5498424c" ulx="330" uly="1394" lrx="574" lry="1428" /><zone xml:id="m-e2839b3e-f8eb-4ea1-b5ff-4c3910ce816c" ulx="396" uly="1438" lrx="506" lry="1476" /><zone xml:id="m-978593ef-4fa7-4cbd-8be0-90cb77023774" ulx="63" uly="1473" lrx="884" lry="1515" /><zone xml:id="m-1dbf60e0-8da9-42de-89b3-dd9f85c5f9d6" ulx="17" uly="1503" lrx="811" lry="1545" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-f11a9f2f-6913-45af-adcf-b4f4d2ad9a78" n="1501" facs="#m-9ab85304-75e3-47d0-872d-59c80949f678" /><div xml:id="m-a4148c05-25c5-4b0a-881b-46df77c26fa1">
            <lg xml:id="m-0a380ac9-bdaa-463d-8b63-7b9fc756ff5d">
              <l xml:id="m-9640fbdc-6c8f-48d9-9ca6-3c5565249a65" facs="#m-dad710f6-9976-47f4-8018-6c1a1d2742ac" label="ambiguous">Occasional Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-b5d7d08e-2185-4866-8db4-4d9c26c3d329" facs="#m-c5226724-9d40-40eb-a84a-0ef37351b15e" label="ambiguous">1301</l><l xml:id="m-1953e6bd-3746-46c1-828d-21caf322c80d" facs="#m-e81963ef-053c-489c-bb2b-6681b003f253" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-7f74c9b1-76fe-401d-b9d2-2799ca661a81" facs="#m-a429278a-3020-4fe5-8d61-5d282a0cd0f6" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui fundásti terram super lin humánae salútis remédia con¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae28ef54-5ed5-4b3f-88df-51986a5a9a0c" facs="#m-3a8948d9-2cea-4837-94a3-fae62bdd0687" label="lyrics-like">I stabilitátem suam, súscipe obla¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f7f5a98-4ed8-4462-a88f-e6af8318aa3a" facs="#m-6cfa6bf3-611a-4305-8c34-606776b92347" label="lyrics-like">vérte; ut qui de terra sunt, et in</l><l xml:id="m-75e959c6-5f4c-44ec-8464-e884b4cae73b" facs="#m-728daca9-a641-454d-a2c5-969f9b2a8277" label="lyrics-like">tiónes et preces pópuli tui : ac tre¬</l><l xml:id="m-2dde7370-bfb5-4b81-8886-3df28f2ee1c4" facs="#m-9881f438-489d-4cc9-8513-e71ee2c76882" label="lyrics-like">terram reverténtur, gáudeant se</l><l xml:id="m-796d1947-7336-485b-937b-acb3f8ce69b0" facs="#m-0918e597-52ac-45d1-8e14-5f4e55757665" label="lyrics-like">méntis terrae periculis pénitus amó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b3133bc-d3ff-4818-8689-a8ef7d2e46e1" facs="#m-a0cd16b9-002e-4e1b-92d7-262404fe6adb" label="lyrics-like">fieri sancta conversatióne caeléstes.</l><l xml:id="m-2a297187-02f8-4202-80f1-bd3b090647ab" facs="#m-68eeec6c-8560-45c2-9144-6986ccb1f355" label="lyrics-like">tis, divínae tuae iracúndiae terróres,l Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-67599ac5-07f1-478b-b74f-33a4a7baba21" facs="#m-4f46a262-6c6f-4964-9037-7b125fb0f964" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-640e6407-8693-4db0-89bf-f937620542ab" facs="#m-7d8ff12f-ec88-4105-a420-ec98cc8b8ab9" label="lyrics-like">THUére nos, Dómine quaésumus, firma; ut mortálium corda cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-59159790-3aac-482b-a320-742cea06da23" facs="#m-6c75f444-5054-4093-a826-9b4316955292" label="lyrics-like">I tua sancta suméntes : et ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-259d3afe-7431-48f8-bf39-34760dcdb27a" facs="#m-f0b5e3cf-4923-4bc9-be5f-5e66a37c7490" label="lyrics-like">scant, et te indignánte tália flagélla</l><l xml:id="m-d4953489-8f5e-4da6-9795-5b3251318063" facs="#m-6f84f8b9-f30d-434e-906a-fb78a2d54b83" label="lyrics-like">ram, quam vídimus nostris iniqui-l prodire, et te miseránte cessáre.</l><l xml:id="m-45e8b720-27cf-4881-823c-f1ed4ad8cc8c" facs="#m-36d422e5-55af-46a7-92f9-55655ad2b63c" label="lyrics-like">tátibus treméntem, supérno múnere! Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7f78a5d0-ee05-4fbd-a2e1-151c2632f392" facs="#m-c14988e7-97e5-4aca-99f7-b156926c4d71" label="text-like">To beg for Rain.</l><l xml:id="m-07379024-0167-46d3-81cc-ababc09e381f" facs="#m-9a8d1a31-3c52-4406-9b45-9b153371ebd5" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c561e7e1-8907-4033-a7d3-3eed63656050" facs="#m-dac48e7e-e6d0-4497-bc79-cd57fff86416" label="lyrics-like">Eus, in quo vívimus, movémur,[ subsídiis sufficiénter adjúti, sempi¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc7207e3-72c3-4562-a45b-84aeab7ebee9" facs="#m-d5334fee-c47e-46f5-9f96-1a7785246337" label="lyrics-like">I et sumus: plúviam nobis tri- térna fiduciálius appetámus. Per</l><l xml:id="m-91a62da0-4939-4733-9f24-e1dcba3ec332" facs="#m-9a301edd-ab8c-44f8-8223-f00c9551422b" label="lyrics-like">bue congruéntem; ut praeséntibus! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5da32f15-a230-4271-87bc-254a361270a5" facs="#m-903790a4-651f-43fb-b9ac-7d7b373cf9a5" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-89974a7a-7897-4c29-9f31-0fe6231eb403" facs="#m-f57cfcb5-8efe-4129-8f7e-4c3cd8bcc768" label="lyrics-like">Blátis, quaésumus Dómine, pla-] num nobis tribue plúviae sufficién¬</l><l xml:id="m-c20fbb9e-8539-41c3-8ff2-26ae6be0c337" facs="#m-3a413094-c2fe-4d6c-81d5-f248ccbaaf1d" label="lyrics-like">U cáre munéribus: et opportú- tis auxilium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-db7bdef9-73e9-4322-a8d0-9909572267b8" facs="#m-5a03eaab-383b-4449-afc5-0f20465c87ed" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e6d25a08-ccc0-4678-8b9b-6f743e3671be" facs="#m-d46fb2fc-d34d-4233-89f6-bc37a797c302" label="lyrics-like">A nobis, quaésumus Dómine,l terrae fáciem fluéntis caeléstibus</l><l xml:id="m-a82e941d-13d4-4fa9-b558-153313434496" facs="#m-ab00727d-dc3e-4b11-af6d-e684abdc6710" label="lyrics-like">U plúviam salutárem: et áridam dignánter infúnde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ab75051e-a354-4400-a4a6-e8c27b78b6ce" facs="#m-ee0256ce-cd7c-4f3f-bd35-7496daf395c1" label="text-like">To beg for Fine Weather.</l><l xml:id="m-5f04e578-abbe-4873-9b1a-2461e948389e" facs="#m-a3d9346b-1190-41e6-ab21-4e5f1bcf799f" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7ca72864-24fb-48ad-985c-897accf2b354" facs="#m-55ba630c-c8a3-41fb-a3ba-55308b0f41b9" label="lyrics-like">D te nos, Dómine, clamántes juste pro peccátis nostris affligimur,</l><l xml:id="m-2a829739-ad8e-40af-aa52-51670371f6af" facs="#m-95541b32-7a34-45e8-bc49-9159d146a6e3" label="lyrics-like">Il exáudi: et áëris serenitátem misericórdia tua praeveniénte cle¬</l><l xml:id="m-ccd10bd2-9991-4bf2-822a-6d6f85d0298d" facs="#m-78db354b-ac29-4957-b227-d960506f41a3" label="lyrics-like">nobis tribue supplicántibus; ut qui l méntiam sentiámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e64465a2-df45-4399-823f-d02e38aadf13" facs="#m-caa7c597-3118-499d-9c6f-454908208798" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-763a3e1b-9ab7-4d60-af88-f150e5d3b3c9" facs="#m-1e230983-b484-4a85-8a90-348a79e5e3cf" label="lyrics-like">DRaevéniat nos, quaésumus Dó-[ secrándas deférimus, benignus as</l><l xml:id="m-ba992e1e-8af5-4659-bd1e-c162a59faeff" facs="#m-951354c0-9958-4cb6-bc8a-34ee7399c574" label="lyrics-like">L mine, grátia tua semper, et súme; ut per intercessiónem San¬</l><l xml:id="m-90060adc-cd4b-46a1-8ddc-6e51e5c8f7df" facs="#m-389da6ce-74ba-4d78-b910-cce1e0f1181d" label="lyrics-like">subsequátur : et has oblatiónes, quas ctórum tuórum, cunctis nobis profi¬</l><l xml:id="m-372cc923-21b1-4ae2-998e-dc87225e6ae7" facs="#m-31ed840c-2427-4519-84f4-1678b6319ddf" label="lyrics-like">pro peccátis nostris nómini tuo con-Iciant ad salútem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bedfb6cd-c5bd-40f3-829d-c06afe5549e7" facs="#m-d18e7d94-f772-4648-8c96-737a8270e296" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b3491142-8022-4a92-be29-bdfda80e64ef" facs="#m-8a5368b7-ab63-4771-8589-8f40ef310f48" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnipotens Deus, tem vultus tui nobis impertiri di¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ab1a83c-7486-4c78-b699-576a09e7c058" facs="#m-1300e82f-f0c5-46a4-ba53-54c12aea85b1" label="lyrics-like">U cleméntiam tuam : ut inundán- gnéris. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-54a97211-4f86-4981-803e-bf05866e661d" facs="#m-b69865f2-44a2-41aa-ba19-64fd7766826e" label="lyrics-like">tiam coérceas imbrium, et hilaritá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d518bc58-2372-4cb6-bddc-65b4665180f8" facs="#m-838b6b3b-9180-448e-9d8a-f58e5498424c" label="ambiguous">To avert Storms.</l><l xml:id="m-a081377a-ac9f-4790-b899-4c713e3acb22" facs="#m-e2839b3e-f8eb-4ea1-b5ff-4c3910ce816c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b011b3fa-9599-404d-96f9-3343c0a612cb" facs="#m-978593ef-4fa7-4cbd-8be0-90cb77023774" label="lyrics-like">Domo tua, quaésumus Dómine,] et aëreárum discédat malignitas</l><l xml:id="m-feb91e07-1210-44e8-8c4f-f82121d9f340" facs="#m-1dbf60e0-8da9-42de-89b3-dd9f85c5f9d6" label="lyrics-like">Al spiritáles nequitiae repellántur : l tempestátum. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>